{"id":193458906,"slug":"i-really-like-this-podcast-called","title":"I Really Like This Podcast Called \"Drug Story\"","subtitle":"A palate cleansing sorbet!","post_date":"2026-04-07T15:16:51.967Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/i-really-like-this-podcast-called","wordcount":402,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:44:20.159Z","body_sha256":"a3ddec4f82333a0c1a3ad7197e0e5482fb7f996f061cd4b0c781696c7e3451ba","text_words":519,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>My readers will not be surprised to hear that your editor-in-chief, Owen Scott Muir, has a lot going on.  For example, I was just awarded the status of “Fellow of the Clinical TMS Society,” which is a big deal.  It also adds yet more awkward letters after my name, which now ends with “M.D., DFAACAP, FCTMSS.”  There are <em>too many</em> letters.  I have another live event coming up, <a href=\"https://www.rapidmentalhealth.com\">Rapid Acting Mental Health Treatment, a.k.a. RAMHT 2026 APA</a>.   It’s happening on May 16th, in San Francisco, and you can get your tickets now.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AGWE!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0bc994f6-6ba1-4d75-bc67-8f512a6bf117_2796x1553.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AGWE!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0bc994f6-6ba1-4d75-bc67-8f512a6bf117_2796x1553.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AGWE!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0bc994f6-6ba1-4d75-bc67-8f512a6bf117