om%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0bc994f6-6ba1-4d75-bc67-8f512a6bf117_2796x1553.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AGWE!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0bc994f6-6ba1-4d75-bc67-8f512a6bf117_2796x1553.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AGWE!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0bc994f6-6ba1-4d75-bc67-8f512a6bf117_2796x1553.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Left to right: Domink Middleman (Mdhub), Jonathan Selzer (Simple Practice), Edwin Wong (psyrin.ai), Tanel Petelot (emobot), and the maestro himself, Grady Hannah (RAMHT cofounder) in January’s JPM Event)</figcaption></figure></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.eventbrite.com/e/ramht-apa-tickets-1983465503715?utm-campaign=social&amp;utm-content=attendeeshare&amp;utm-medium=discovery&amp;utm-term=listing&amp;utm-source=cp&amp;aff=ebdsshcopyurl&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Get RAMHT Tickets Now!&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/ramht-apa-tickets-1983465503715?utm-campaign=social&amp;utm-content=attendeeshare&amp;utm-medium=discovery&amp;utm-term=listing&amp;utm-source=cp&amp;aff=ebdsshcopyurl\"><span>Get RAMHT Tickets Now!</span></a></p><p><strong>I also got my most recent book in print, <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/ai-wont-replace-me?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">with the help of Claude Code for image reformatting</a>.  It is called<a href=\"https://amzn.to/4tBePKI\"> Inessential Pharmacology</a>.  (Amazon affiliate link).</strong>  </p><div><hr></div><p>Speaking of drugs, I have found a great podcast recently that tells the kind of stories I find compelling.  It's called Drug Story!  I wanna share it with you today.</p><p>It's a stunningly told and well-balanced story about antidepressants, but this is one such tale: </p><div class=\"embedded-post-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;id&quot;:185116655,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.drugstory.co/p/zoloft-and-depression&quot;,&quot;publication_id&quot;:3015315,&quot;embedding_publication_id&quot;:null,&quot;publication_name&quot;:&quot;Drug Story&quot;,&quot;publication_logo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nNYL!,f_auto,q_