3 21 7.03914 20.7893 7.41421 20.4142C7.78929 20.0391 8 19.5304 8 19V16C8 15.4696 7.78929 14.9609 7.41421 14.5858C7.03914 14.2107 6.53043 14 6 14H3V19Z\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</svg></div><div class=\"embedded-post-title\">On Xanax and anxiety </div></div><div class=\"embedded-post-body\">Do you feel that…</div><div class=\"embedded-post-cta-wrapper\"><div class=\"embedded-post-cta-icon\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <path classname=\"inner-triangle\" d=\"M10 8L16 12L10 16V8Z\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</svg></div><span class=\"embedded-post-cta\">Listen now</span></div><div class=\"embedded-post-meta\">7 months ago · 8 likes · Thomas Goetz</div></a></div><p>This is a great podcast.  I hope you enjoy it as much as I have.</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><div><hr></div><p>A few recent media hits that caught my attention (from around the web) to catch my readers up:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.wfxb.com/2026/03/30/take-care-of-your-mental-health-with-radial/\">WFXB shares the story of PRISM neurofeedback for PTSD in South Carolina.</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://themicrodose.substack.com/p/compass-pathways-partnering-with\">Radial announces a large-scale collaboration with CompassPathways</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2025/09/23/3154619/0/en/Videra-Health-Launches-Check-on-Mom-the-First-Free-AI-Powered-Postpartum-Depression-Screener.html\">Videra’s technology brings added vigilance to postpartum depression screening.</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://wpde.com/news/local/gallery/new-mental-health-clinic-in-conway-to-address-critical-needs-ben-greenzweig-radial-horry-county-needs-south-carolina-crisis-resources-america-stats?photo=2\">Conway, South Carolina, is home to a new Radial location.</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.ucl.ac.uk/centre-digital-innovation/case-studies/2023/sep/psyrin-leveraging-ai-rapid-assessment-serious-mental-illness-through-speech\">Psyrin tells the story of how we can understand our mental health just from the sound of our voices.</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.prnewswire.com/il/news-releases/graymatters-health-announces-appointment-of-five-expert-advisors-302723227.html\">GrayMatters announces 5 strategic advisors (including yours truly)</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.biospace.com/press-releases/radial-announces-publication-of-landmark-study-of-accelerated-deep-tms-for-depression\">BrainsWay (and friends) got out two papers at once on its SWIFT TMS protocol</a> pivotal trial.</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://refreshmiami.com/news/neurolief-raises-6m-to-fuel-u-s-rollout-of-at-home-depression-therapy/\">Neurolief raises another $6M from lead investor BrainsWay</a> to bring ProlivRx to market.</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.ucl.ac.uk/centre-digital-innovation/case-studies/2023/sep/psyrin-leveraging-ai-rapid-assessment-serious-mental-illness-through-speech\">Psyrin tells the story of how we can understand our mental health just from the sound of our voices.</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.investing.com/news/company-news/hope-therapeutics-partners-with-emobot-on-ai-monitoring-tool-93CH-4587426\">Emobot announces a collaboration with NRx to bring multimodal AI to mental health</a></p></li></ul><div><hr></div><p><em>RAMHT is the live-action version of this newsletter, co-created with Grady Hannah.   is proud to note that <a href=\"https://www.salmahealth.com\">Salma Health</a>, <a href=\"https://beckleyclinical.com\">Beckley Clinical</a>, <a href=\"https://www.nrxpharma.com\">NRx</a>, <a href=\"https://www.graymatters-health.com\">Graymatters Health</a>, <a href=\"https://www.ampahealth.com\">Ampa Health</a>, <a href=\"https://www.simplepractice.com/lp/product-suf-b-70-50-pm25/?g_acctid=419-488-5451&amp;g_adgroupid=180018692114&amp;g_adid=741353178670&amp;g_adtype=search&amp;g_campaign=Brand+%7C+Desktop&amp;g_campaignid=16427199590&amp;g_keyword=simple%20practice&amp;g_keywordid=kwd-11226053256&amp;g_network=g&amp;utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_campaign=brand_desktop&amp;utm_adgroup=core_exact_two_words&amp;utm_term=simple%20practice&amp;device=c&amp;network=g&amp;matchtype=e&amp;device=c&amp;utm_content=741353178670&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gad_campaignid=16427199590&amp;gbraid=0AAAAADqOPoNIdqTqd6Z5oRXuuWFkNU1j2\">Simple Practice</a>,  <a href=\"https://www.emobot.fr/en/home\">Emobot</a>, <a href=\"https://psyrin.ai\">Psyrin</a>, <a href=\"https://viderahealth.com\">Videra Health</a>, and <a href=\"https://definiumtx.com\">Definium Theraputics</a> have joined the club as sponsors (among others to be announced!) of our next events.  We will be bringing more tools for advocacy to the masses!</em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/i-really-like-this-podcast-called?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/i-really-like-this-podcast-called?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>","text":"My readers will not be surprised to hear that your editor-in-chief, Owen Scott Muir, has a lot going on. For example, I was just awarded the status of “Fellow of the Clinical TMS Society,” which is a big deal. It also adds yet more awkward letters after my name, which now ends with “M.D., DFAACAP, FCTMSS.” There are too many letters. I have another live event coming up, Rapid Acting Mental Health Treatment, a.k.a. RAMHT 2026 APA . It’s happening on May 16th, in San Francisco, and you can get your tickets now.\n\nLeft to right: Domink Middleman (Mdhub), Jonathan Selzer (Simple Practice), Edwin Wong (psyrin.ai), Tanel Petelot (emobot), and the maestro himself, Grady Hannah (RAMHT cofounder) in January’s JPM Event)\n\nGet RAMHT Tickets Now!\n\nI also got my most recent book in print, with the help of Claude Code for image reformatting . It is called Inessential Pharmacology . (Amazon affiliate link).\n\nSpeaking of drugs, I have found a great podcast recently that tells the kind of stories I find compelling. It's called Drug Story! I wanna share it with you today.\n\nIt's a stunningly told and well-balanced story about antidepressants, but this is one such tale:\n\nDrug Story\n\nOn Zoloft & depression\n\nThere’s no blood test for depression, no MRI or CT scan that can detect it. Because depression, like a lot of things involved with mental health, is invisible…\n\nListen now\n\n8 months ago · 6 likes · Thomas Goetz\n\nThe team also tells a pretty remarkable tale about anxiolytic medications like Xanax:\n\nDrug Story\n\nOn Xanax and anxiety\n\nDo you feel that…\n\nListen now\n\n7 months ago · 8 likes · Thomas Goetz\n\nThis is a great podcast. I hope you enjoy it as much as I have.\n\nSubscribe now\n\nA few recent media hits that caught my attention (from around the web) to catch my readers up:\n\n• WFXB shares the story of PRISM neurofeedback for PTSD in South Carolina.\n\n• Radial announces a large-scale collaboration with CompassPathways\n\n• Videra’s technology brings added vigilance to postpartum depression screening.\n\n• Conway, South Carolina, is home to a new Radial location.\n\n• Psyrin tells the story of how we can understand our mental health just from the sound of our voices.\n\n• GrayMatters announces 5 strategic advisors (including yours truly)\n\n• BrainsWay (and friends) got out two papers at once on its SWIFT TMS protocol pivotal trial.\n\n• Neurolief raises another $6M from lead investor BrainsWay to bring ProlivRx to market.\n\n• Psyrin tells the story of how we can understand our mental health just from the sound of our voices.\n\n• Emobot announces a collaboration with NRx to bring multimodal AI to mental health\n\nRAMHT is the live-action version of this newsletter, co-created with Grady Hannah. is proud to note that Salma Health , Beckley Clinical , NRx , Graymatters Health , Ampa Health , Simple Practice , Emobot , Psyrin , Videra Health , and Definium Theraputics have joined the club as sponsors (among others to be announced!) of our next events. We will be bringing more tools for advocacy to the masses!\n\nShare"}